"""
Web interface adapter — login, chat UI, WebSocket endpoint, admin pages.

Routes (mounted at root, no prefix):
  GET  /              → single-page chat UI (requires auth cookie)
  GET  /login         → login form
  POST /login         → authenticate → set httponly JWT cookie → redirect /
  GET  /logout        → clear cookie → redirect /login
  GET  /chat.css      → stylesheet (same-origin, satisfies CSP default-src 'self')
  GET  /chat.js       → WebSocket client JS
  GET  /ws            → WebSocket chat endpoint (cookie-auth)
  GET  /archive       → file explorer for the document archive
  GET  /funding       → live funding opportunities report
  GET  /pending-changes → admin page listing pending agent changes

Archive API (cookie-auth, JSON responses):
  GET    /api/archive/ls?path=  → list directory contents
  POST   /api/archive/upload    → multipart file upload (index permission)
  POST   /api/archive/mkdir     → create folder (index permission)
  DELETE /api/archive/item?path= → delete file or folder (delete_documents permission)

WebSocket protocol:
  Client sends:  {"message": "<text>"}
  Server sends:  {"type": "token", "content": "<chunk>"}  (streaming)
                 {"type": "done"}                          (end of response)
                 {"type": "error", "detail": "<msg>"}
"""
